{"meta":{"id":"tt1116184","type":"movie","name":"Jackass 3D","description":"Jackass 3D es una película filmada en 3D y la tercera película de la serie de Jackass. Sigue la misma premisa que las dos primeras películas, así como las series de TV. Es una compilación de varias travesuras, trucos y parodias. Antes de que la película comience, una breve introducción es hecha por el Beavis y Butt-head explicando la tecnología 3D detrás de la película. La entrada presenta el molde alineación y luego atacarse por varios objetos en el ralentí. La película marca el 10o aniversario de la licencia, comenzada en 2000.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPirN07su7LFixyZyLrNMMQ9u1E.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2RmJI0jfXMFF0br3pXQsHiy3lgh.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7bf4ZTEWTRJzydh6r0o160466zU.png","genres":["Comedia","Documental","Acción"],"releaseInfo":"2010","released":"2010-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"6.6","runtime":"94 min","trailers":[{"source":"WWmwYzJ0Rs8","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Johnny Knoxville","Bam Margera","Ryan Dunn","Steve-O","Chris Pontius","Jason 'Wee Man' Acuña","Preston Lacy","Ehren McGhehey","Dave England","Phil Margera","April Margera","Loomis Fall","Jeff Tremaine","Brandon Novak","Tony Hawk"],"director":["Jeff Tremaine"],"writer":["Johnny Knoxville","Spike Jonze","Derek Freda","Barry Owen Smoter","Trip Taylor"],"links":[{"name":"Johnny Knoxville","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Johnny%20Knoxville"},{"name":"Bam Margera","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Bam%20Margera"},{"name":"Ryan Dunn","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Ryan%20Dunn"},{"name":"Steve-O","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Steve-O"},{"name":"Chris Pontius","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Chris%20Pontius"},{"name":"Jason 'Wee Man' Acuña","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jason%20'Wee%20Man'%20Acu%C3%B1a"},{"name":"Preston Lacy","catego